        "jsCode": "// 模拟输入的待抓取主页 URL 列表\nreturn [\n  { json: { profile_url: \"https://www.douyin.com/user/MS4wLjABAAAAncMfATtm3s5GN8tiPLVIWsnNIGU5EEL9_0AwgcvTLHyxOtuOJQJ_7yWMKFFS3iiW/\" } },\n  { json: { profile_url: \"https://www.douyin.com/user/MS4wLjABAAAAEcUqmvHy1KZfGKsCghoeP0Yy3pUfIXYvdPyl2OZBB_k/\" } }\n];\n"
